# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Platform projects produced by `tauri ios init` / `tauri android init`.
# They are fully derived from tauri.conf.json, Cargo.toml and the CLI version,
# carry no decision of ours yet, and ship with trailing whitespace that trips
# the repository's staged-whitespace gate. Regenerate them instead of tracking
# them; revisit this once signing config or manifest edits live in there.
/gen/
